    <item>
      <title>automation</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/catalog/automation.map/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/catalog/automation.map/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Dumb people want smart things to work for them.&#xA;Smart people know things are to fucking stupid to work without being controlled.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Random internet user, 2025-03&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A COMPUTER&#xA;CAN NEVER BE HELD ACCOUNTABLE&#xA;THEREFORE A COMPUTER MUST NEVER&#xA;MAKE A MANAGEMENT DECISION&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;IBM slide circa 1979&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Once men turned their thinking over to&#xA;machines in the hope that this would set&#xA;them free. But that only permitted other men&#xA;with machines to enslave them.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Shounen Manga</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/catalog/shounen-manga.writing/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/catalog/shounen-manga.writing/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;characters which are not popular enough must be killed, literally, or by omission&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;shounen-is-populist&#34;&gt;Shounen is Populist &lt;a href=&#34;#shounen-is-populist&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;i class=&#34;material-icons align-middle&#34;&gt;link&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;the writer of spy x family:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;“I gave up on what I originally wanted to draw and drew what the world wants to see, not myself, so I have no attachment to the characters (laughs).”&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description>
    </item>
